### Variables
@baseUrl = http://localhost:5080
@token = {{loginCookie.response.headers.Set-Cookie}}

### ============================================================
### OPENIDDICT SCOPES API (MasterAdminOnly)
### ============================================================

### List all scopes
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/scopes/
Cookie: {{token}}

### Create a new scope
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/scopes/
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: {{token}}

{
    "name": "my_api",
    "displayName": "My API Scope",
    "description": "Access to My API resources",
    "resources": ["my_api_resource"],
    "openIdConnectClaims": ["sub", "email", "name"]
}

### Update a scope
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/scopes/my_api
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: {{token}}

{
    "displayName": "My Updated API Scope",
    "description": "Updated scope description"
}

### Delete a scope
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/scopes/my_api
Cookie: {{token}}
